            "line": 130,
            "text": "theorem weight_sum (c : ℕ) (hc : 1 ≤ c) (X : ℝ) :\n    ∑ q ∈ (Icc 1 ⌊X⌋₊).filter (fun q => (qt q : ℝ) ≤ X),\n        (if c ∣ q then TernaryGoldbach.wq q c else 0) / q.totient =\n      c / c.totient * (kap c * Gq (qt c) (X / qt c)) :=",
